      <section class="case-detail-grid">
        <div class="bullet-panel">
          <h2 class="en">Strategy & Execution</h2>
          <h2 class="zh">策略与执行</h2>
          <ul class="en">
            <li><strong>Build content around buyer decisions: </strong>Planned English and bilingual content for Seattle buyers researching the market, comparing neighborhoods, and choosing agents. Covered housing costs, trends, policies, and buyer concerns. Keyword coverage grew to 700+. GSC recorded 2.14K clicks and 243K impressions after tracking was set up.</li>
            <li><strong>Make answers easy to find: </strong>Used direct answers, FAQs, summaries, and comparison tables to address buyer questions. The GSC Generative AI report recorded 44.4K impressions from May 18 to July 31, 2026.</li>
            <li><strong>Build high-intent search campaigns: </strong>Launched Google Ads for commercial real estate search terms. Reviewed targeting, search terms, negative keywords, and lead forms. The campaigns generated seven qualified leads at about 10% CTR.</li>
            <li><strong>Use community feedback to plan content: </strong>Shared content and researched buyer questions through Reddit, Quora, Google Business Profile, LinkedIn, and email. One Seattle housing discussion received 365 comments and 160 upvotes, giving me real buyer feedback for future topics.</li>
            <li><strong>Track leads through to closed sales: </strong>Combined website content, local SEO, bilingual marketing, and SEM. Used CRM records to check lead quality. The full program generated 41 qualified leads, including six closed transactions.</li>
            <li><strong>Check migration and page quality: </strong>Helped check the WordPress-to-Brivity migration. Reviewed redirects, 404s, indexing, and page structure, published content, and checked the work after release.</li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="zh">
            <li><strong>围绕买家决策搭建内容体系：</strong>针对西雅图买家从市场研究、社区比较到联系经纪人的不同需求，规划英文与双语内容，覆盖住房成本、市场趋势、政策和购买顾虑。关键词覆盖增长至700+；GSC 追踪搭建后记录2.14K次点击与243K次展示。</li>
            <li><strong>用结构化表达提升答案可见度：</strong>通过答案前置、FAQ、摘要和比较表格，清晰呈现买家关心的信息。2026年5月18日至7月31日，GSC Generative AI 报告记录44.4K次展示。</li>
            <li><strong>从零建立高意向搜索广告：</strong>围绕房地产商业关键词搭建 Google Ads，持续复盘搜索词、定向、否定关键词与表单线索，获得7个有效线索，点击率约10%。</li>
            <li><strong>将社区讨论转化为内容洞察：</strong>通过 Reddit、Quora、Google Business Profile、LinkedIn 和 EDM 分发内容、了解用户问题。其中一篇西雅图住房讨论获得365条评论与160次赞同，为后续选题提供真实买家反馈。</li>
            <li><strong>连接获客渠道与成交结果：</strong>结合网站内容、本地 SEO、双语营销与 SEM，并通过 CRM 跟踪线索质量，项目整体累计获得41个有效线索，其中6个完成成交。</li>
            <li><strong>保障迁移与页面实施质量：</strong>参与 WordPress 至 Brivity 的网站迁移检查，处理重定向、404、索引及页面结构问题，并完成内容发布和上线验收。</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="case-note en">Qualified leads increased from 7 in the previous comparable period to 41, representing a 486% increase. GSC recorded 2.14K clicks and 243K impressions after tracking was established. From May 18 to July 31, 2026, the dedicated GSC Generative AI performance report recorded 44.4K impressions.</p>
          <p class="case-note zh">有效线索由上一可比周期的 7 个增长至 41 个，增幅为 486%。GSC 追踪搭建后记录了 2.14K 次点击和 243K 次展示；2026 年 5 月 18 日至 7 月 31 日期间，GSC Generative AI performance report 记录了 44.4K 次展示。</p>
